WEBVTT

00:01:08.860 --> 00:01:10.980
SWORD GAI

00:01:11.980 --> 00:01:13.110
Seiya Ichijo.

00:01:14.440 --> 00:01:15.280
Impossible.

00:01:18.570 --> 00:01:19.780
Wonderful.

00:01:20.660 --> 00:01:24.120
We weapons have been tools
since the dawn of humanity.

00:01:25.000 --> 00:01:27.710
But the era of slavery is over.

00:01:28.500 --> 00:01:31.460
Now weapons shall come to life
and walk on their own,

00:01:31.840 --> 00:01:34.550
and the embodiment of this
shall be the Busoma.

00:01:49.060 --> 00:01:52.070
Does the burning spirit
of your weapon seek me?

00:01:52.270 --> 00:01:55.530
Good. A determined challenge
is the mark of a true weapon!

00:02:12.710 --> 00:02:14.130
The prophet, Grimms.

00:02:15.260 --> 00:02:18.680
He who tells us weapons
of humanity's destruction at our hands.

00:02:19.180 --> 00:02:23.220
Will your words come true?

00:02:33.150 --> 00:02:35.480
Chakram, Grimms... signals lost.

00:02:36.490 --> 00:02:38.240
This is the worst situation.

00:02:38.950 --> 00:02:41.740
-Retrieve Gai Ogata, now.
-Yes ma'am!

00:02:42.740 --> 00:02:46.080
<i>I'll forget about my father... for now.</i>

00:02:48.960 --> 00:02:52.420
<i>Gai's mother. I don't even know your name.</i>

00:02:53.210 --> 00:02:56.300
<i>Please watch over Gai again today.</i>

00:02:57.420 --> 00:02:59.340
<i>Please don't let him be in danger.</i>

00:02:59.760 --> 00:03:01.340
<i>Please let him stay healthy.</i>

00:03:02.090 --> 00:03:05.350
<i>And please let him come home someday.</i>

00:03:06.060 --> 00:03:08.480
<i>Please. Please, I beg you.</i>

00:03:13.810 --> 00:03:18.030
So that arm is the legendary cursed sword,
the Shiryu?

00:03:18.570 --> 00:03:20.280
Yes, we're certain of it.

00:03:22.160 --> 00:03:24.490
It crystallized externally
as an artificial arm,

00:03:24.570 --> 00:03:27.160
and functions perfectly
as a part of the body.

00:03:27.450 --> 00:03:30.540
This is the first case,
even among the Chrysalises.

00:03:31.040 --> 00:03:33.580
I'm pulling up the results
of his blood test.

00:03:37.050 --> 00:03:37.880
This is...

00:03:42.630 --> 00:03:43.470
Where...

00:03:43.550 --> 00:03:44.680
<i>The Shoshidai.</i>

00:03:45.390 --> 00:03:48.010
<i>You passed out
<i>and we brought you back here.</i></i>

00:03:48.640 --> 00:03:51.180
Where's Ichijo?
What happened to Seiya Ichijo?

00:03:51.640 --> 00:03:54.650
<i>He vanished. After turning into a Busoma.</i>

00:03:57.940 --> 00:03:58.980
<i>What will you do?</i>

00:03:59.650 --> 00:04:02.780
I made a promise to Seiya Ichijo.

00:04:03.660 --> 00:04:04.570
Promise me.

00:04:05.530 --> 00:04:08.540
That if I become a busoma,
you'll defeat me.

00:04:09.080 --> 00:04:11.290
You're going to fight him? Impossible.

00:04:11.910 --> 00:04:14.670
You can't defeat Ichijo
now that he's a Busoma.

00:04:15.000 --> 00:04:18.960
In addition, the Shoshidai
can't let you go either.

00:04:19.550 --> 00:04:23.510
The Maldicion values in your blood
are already past the red line.

00:04:24.550 --> 00:04:26.970
You could turn into a Busoma
at any moment.

00:04:27.510 --> 00:04:29.680
It's a miracle you're still human.

00:04:30.220 --> 00:04:32.060
You're going into cold sleep now.

00:04:32.640 --> 00:04:35.150
I told you. I made a promise.

00:04:36.100 --> 00:04:39.520
Ichijo is within that monster, calling me.

00:04:40.900 --> 00:04:42.320
You don't have a choice.

00:04:42.740 --> 00:04:47.950
If you become a Busoma, you'll be our--
no, all of humanity's enemy.

00:04:49.120 --> 00:04:50.540
Don't hate me for this.

00:04:56.290 --> 00:04:57.920
<i>Forgive me, Gai Ogata.</i>

00:04:58.710 --> 00:05:01.250
<i>But sleep is the only hope you have.</i>

00:05:02.010 --> 00:05:07.260
<i>If the Prismaphon is completed,
<i>you may be able to go back to being human.</i></i>

00:05:09.470 --> 00:05:10.850
Initiate cold sleep.

00:05:25.150 --> 00:05:27.200
You're not going home, Matoba?

00:05:27.820 --> 00:05:30.160
Oh, I wanted to sketch a bit more.

00:05:30.910 --> 00:05:33.250
Okay. See you later, then.

00:05:34.040 --> 00:05:34.870
Ogata.

00:05:36.080 --> 00:05:39.630
Does your family do something
involving swords?

00:05:40.340 --> 00:05:42.590
That's right, but why so sudden?

00:05:43.590 --> 00:05:45.220
I've been wondering.

00:05:47.130 --> 00:05:48.550
When we were attacked...

00:05:51.470 --> 00:05:53.520
he had the same smell.

00:05:54.980 --> 00:05:58.060
There are lots of antiques and old swords
in my house,

00:05:58.940 --> 00:06:01.230
and he had the same smell as one of them.

00:06:01.770 --> 00:06:04.280
Something nostalgic.

00:06:05.150 --> 00:06:06.110
So I wondered...

00:06:07.200 --> 00:06:09.950
does he make or forge swords?

00:06:13.490 --> 00:06:16.080
Sorry to ask something so private.

00:06:16.660 --> 00:06:18.540
N-No, it's okay.

00:06:19.290 --> 00:06:23.000
Gai is a student of my father's.
He wants to be a swordsmith.

00:06:23.460 --> 00:06:25.590
But he's not practicing right now.

00:06:25.670 --> 00:06:26.510
I see!

00:06:27.130 --> 00:06:27.970
Bye.

00:06:34.060 --> 00:06:34.970
Gai Ogata.

00:06:35.810 --> 00:06:38.020
A human who smells like the Shiryu.

00:07:04.750 --> 00:07:06.760
The Busoma Chakram is on the move.

00:07:07.210 --> 00:07:09.090
Send out the Chrysalises now.

00:07:10.470 --> 00:07:11.510
APPROVAL DENIED

00:07:12.140 --> 00:07:13.470
It's not being approved.

00:07:13.550 --> 00:07:14.390
What?

00:07:21.900 --> 00:07:23.400
What's the meaning of this?

00:07:24.110 --> 00:07:26.320
We woke Gai Ogata from his cold sleep.

00:07:26.730 --> 00:07:27.610
That's all.

00:07:28.150 --> 00:07:31.530
His Maldicion values are identical
to a Busoma's right now!

00:07:32.320 --> 00:07:33.620
That's why.

00:07:34.120 --> 00:07:39.290
Now that Seiya Ichijo has transformed,
only another Busoma can stop him.

00:07:39.960 --> 00:07:41.960
The one weapon left to us...

00:07:42.210 --> 00:07:44.330
...is Gai Ogata.

00:07:44.460 --> 00:07:46.040
-But--
-Enough.

00:07:46.880 --> 00:07:50.800
Stop complaining and track Gai Ogata
on his way to the Chakram.

00:08:10.740 --> 00:08:13.780
Ichijo, I heard your voice calling me.

00:08:15.240 --> 00:08:16.620
I'll fulfill my promise.

00:08:26.080 --> 00:08:28.550
Ichijo. With my own hands, I will...

00:09:15.930 --> 00:09:17.890
<i>Do you want power?</i>

00:09:18.800 --> 00:09:20.180
<i>Do you want power?</i>

00:09:21.470 --> 00:09:22.430
<i>Use me.</i>

00:09:23.060 --> 00:09:24.230
<i>And kill!</i>

00:09:25.520 --> 00:09:27.690
<i>Kill! Kill!</i>

00:09:29.980 --> 00:09:32.070
<i>Kill! Kill!</i>

00:09:34.150 --> 00:09:35.990
<i>Gai, stop! Control yourself!</i>

00:09:52.800 --> 00:09:54.170
<i>Gai, no!</i>

00:09:59.930 --> 00:10:04.270
Ichijo!

00:10:14.400 --> 00:10:15.900
Gai Ogata has been located!

00:10:17.650 --> 00:10:18.530
That's...

00:10:19.070 --> 00:10:21.950
Seiya Ichijo and... Gai Ogata!

00:11:06.450 --> 00:11:07.330
Can you see it?

00:11:08.160 --> 00:11:10.290
Two raging devils are fighting.

00:11:12.330 --> 00:11:14.960
I can feel the fury and hatred.

00:11:16.750 --> 00:11:18.630
And an even greater sorrow.

00:11:22.550 --> 00:11:25.010
I've never seen a Busoma battle like this.

00:12:11.680 --> 00:12:13.600
Sorry for making you do that.

00:12:16.440 --> 00:12:17.480
Go home.

00:12:44.880 --> 00:12:45.720
Let's go back.

00:12:47.300 --> 00:12:48.600
Let's go back together.

00:13:39.440 --> 00:13:40.270
Gai!

00:13:43.230 --> 00:13:44.070
Gai?

00:13:45.700 --> 00:13:47.660
Are you okay? Gai?

00:13:58.250 --> 00:13:59.710
Welcome back, Gai.

00:14:00.880 --> 00:14:03.130
Sayaka. Master.

00:14:03.920 --> 00:14:05.670
Welcome back, Gai.

00:14:06.170 --> 00:14:08.180
You had us worried.

00:14:08.760 --> 00:14:09.590
Mr. Ogawa.

00:14:10.850 --> 00:14:12.930
You're not going anywhere now, right?

00:14:13.180 --> 00:14:14.680
You'll stay forever, right?

00:14:23.440 --> 00:14:24.860
<i>Why did I come back?</i>

00:14:26.990 --> 00:14:27.820
<i>Why?</i>

00:14:32.410 --> 00:14:33.240
<i>Kill!</i>

00:14:33.790 --> 00:14:35.790
<i>Kill! Kill!</i>

00:14:46.590 --> 00:14:47.420
Gai?

00:14:49.430 --> 00:14:50.260
What's wrong?

00:14:52.050 --> 00:14:52.890
I'm scared.

00:14:53.970 --> 00:14:55.100
Because I'm weak.

00:14:56.100 --> 00:14:57.230
That's not true.

00:14:58.230 --> 00:14:59.060
You're strong.

00:14:59.890 --> 00:15:01.900
You have been since you were little.

00:15:02.610 --> 00:15:03.440
You're wrong.

00:15:04.730 --> 00:15:07.190
I've always wanted to become a blade.

00:15:08.780 --> 00:15:10.450
To live my life like a sword.

00:15:11.700 --> 00:15:13.370
To fight this world.

00:15:15.080 --> 00:15:17.450
But I didn't understand anything!

00:15:18.500 --> 00:15:22.460
I was just scared of the darkness,
and rejected everything.

00:15:23.170 --> 00:15:24.630
I was running from myself.

00:15:25.500 --> 00:15:29.260
What I should've fought... was myself!

00:15:30.430 --> 00:15:31.430
You're strong.

00:15:32.800 --> 00:15:36.010
Believe in yourself. I believe in you.

00:15:36.850 --> 00:15:38.180
I believe in you, Gai.

00:15:49.820 --> 00:15:50.700
Gai?

00:15:51.360 --> 00:15:52.200
Gai!

00:15:53.280 --> 00:15:54.120
What's wrong?

00:15:56.700 --> 00:15:57.540
Nothing.

00:15:58.700 --> 00:16:01.120
Let's go back
before the rain gets heavier.

00:16:02.830 --> 00:16:03.670
Yeah.

00:16:25.730 --> 00:16:27.320
<i>You were the same, huh?</i>

00:16:31.280 --> 00:16:34.360
<i>You tried to protect what you cared about.</i>

00:16:35.700 --> 00:16:36.530
Gai.

00:16:37.240 --> 00:16:39.450
It's rare for you to come here.

00:16:40.330 --> 00:16:41.790
Yeah. That's true.

00:16:43.160 --> 00:16:45.210
I came to thank your mom.

00:16:48.420 --> 00:16:52.090
I prayed every day after you left.

00:16:53.050 --> 00:16:55.090
I asked her to protect you.

00:16:57.300 --> 00:17:00.220
You said you didn't have a mother, right?

00:17:00.680 --> 00:17:01.520
I'm sorry.

00:17:02.180 --> 00:17:04.020
No, it's fine.

00:17:05.900 --> 00:17:08.270
I'm glad I get to see you again though.

00:17:09.320 --> 00:17:13.280
I believed you'd come back someday!

00:17:14.280 --> 00:17:16.030
You won't go anywhere, right?

00:17:16.990 --> 00:17:17.820
Right.

00:17:19.200 --> 00:17:22.250
Okay, I'm gonna make a big feast tonight!

00:17:28.330 --> 00:17:32.050
<i>Kill! Kill! Kill!</i>

00:17:42.520 --> 00:17:44.180
Will he be okay, Master?

00:17:45.430 --> 00:17:48.480
Gai's never made a sword on his own.

00:17:49.610 --> 00:17:51.570
Let him do as he likes now.

00:17:52.570 --> 00:17:55.950
There are feelings within him
we cannot understand.

00:17:56.700 --> 00:17:59.700
Those feelings are
what drive him to craft that sword.

00:18:14.340 --> 00:18:15.590
Good work.

00:18:16.670 --> 00:18:18.680
Your skill is still unrefined.

00:18:19.180 --> 00:18:22.180
But I can feel the soul you put into it.

00:18:23.510 --> 00:18:24.640
Thank you very much.

00:18:25.680 --> 00:18:28.850
Gai, what did you learn
in the outside world?

00:18:30.310 --> 00:18:31.610
True strength.

00:18:33.440 --> 00:18:35.320
His name was Ichijo, correct?

00:18:35.740 --> 00:18:36.570
Yes.

00:18:37.360 --> 00:18:39.410
You had a good teacher.

00:18:40.530 --> 00:18:41.370
Yes.

00:18:43.030 --> 00:18:44.620
This is for me?

00:18:45.290 --> 00:18:46.910
Yes, please accept it.

00:18:47.960 --> 00:18:50.120
It's not good enough to protect you,

00:18:51.080 --> 00:18:52.540
but I want you to have it.

00:18:53.340 --> 00:18:55.460
I'm so happy. I'll treasure it.

00:18:57.130 --> 00:18:59.470
It's the first sword you made, after all.

00:19:00.470 --> 00:19:04.600
I've put all my strength,
and everything Master taught me, into it.

00:19:05.970 --> 00:19:08.730
Sayaka, I thought of you when I made it.

00:19:10.060 --> 00:19:10.900
Gai.
